      "text": "events (trace.jsonl):\n  click link \"Daily KPIs - w/c 19 Oct\"\n  click div \"Print allIn new window…\"\n  copy \"Daily KPIs - w/c 19 Oct\"\n  click on the sheet (a drawn grid)\n            ↓\nsteps:\n  s3 go: open the email\n  s4 reveal: the div (weak target)\n  s5 read: copy the subject\nleft out, listed (not lost):\n  x1 a click on a drawn grid",
