    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p4_rules",
      "x": 1950,
      "y": 940,
      "text": "· a double click is one click\n· a selection + its copy = one read\n· tab switches with nothing done\n  in between are dropped\n· noise is removed AND listed\n  (x1, x2… with the reason);\n  the agent can put one back",
