      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Only masked text reaches a model.\nevidence.json, transcript.jsonl and screen.jsonl are masked when written.\ntrace.jsonl, the pictures and voice.m4a never go to a model.\nThe one exception: with Pictures on, the blacked-out pictures\ngo to the vision model for captions.",
      "width": 784,
      "height": 87.5,
